{"speciesId":410,"names":{"fr":"Dinoclier","es":"Shieldon","en":"Shieldon","ja":"タテトプス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A Pokémon that lived in jungles around 100 million years ago. Its facial hide is extremely hard."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It habitually polishes its face by rubbing it against tree trunks. It is weak to attacks from behind."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is outstandingly armored. As a result, it can eat grass and berries without having to fight."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It was generated from a fossil dug out of a layer of clay that was older than anyone knows. It has a sturdy face."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It was generated from a fossil dug out of a layer of clay that was older than anyone knows. It has a sturdy face."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est si bien protégé qu’il peut déguster Baies et herbe fraîche sans craindre de prédateurs."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is outstandingly armored. As a result, it can eat grass and berries without having to fight."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est si bien protégé qu’il peut déguster Baies et herbe fraîche sans craindre de prédateurs."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is outstandingly armored. As a result, it can eat grass and berries without having to fight."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is outstandingly armored. As a result, it can eat grass and berries without having to fight."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is outstandingly armored. As a result, it can eat grass and berries without having to fight."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il a l’habitude de polir son visage en le frottant contre un tronc. Il craint les attaques dans le dos."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se abrillanta la cara frotándola contra los árboles. Es vulnerable a los ataques por la espalda."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It habitually polishes its face by rubbing it against tree trunks. It is weak to attacks from behind."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大木の 幹に こすりつけて 硬い 顔を 磨く 習性。 後ろからの 攻撃に 弱い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est né d’un fossile datant de 100 millions d’années. Son visage est très dur."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Surgió de un fósil de hace 100 millones de años. Su protección facial es tremendamente dura."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It was generated from a fossil dug out of a layer of clay that was older than anyone knows. It has a sturdy face."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"１億年前の 地層から 掘り出された 化石から 生まれた。 とても 頑丈な 顔を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il a l’habitude de polir son visage en le frottant contre un tronc. Il craint les attaques dans le dos."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se abrillanta la cara frotándola contra los árboles. Es vulnerable a los ataques por la espalda."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It habitually polishes its face by rubbing it against tree trunks. It is weak to attacks from behind."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大木の 幹に こすりつけて 硬い 顔を 磨く 習性。 後ろからの 攻撃に 弱い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il est né d’un fossile datant de 100 millions d’années. Son visage est très dur."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Surgió de un fósil de hace 100 millones de años. Su protección facial es tremendamente dura."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It was generated from a fossil dug out of a layer of clay that was older than anyone knows. It has a sturdy face."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"１億年前の 地層から 掘り出された 化石から 生まれた。 とても 頑丈な 顔を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Dans les nombreux fossiles trouvés, presque aucune plaque faciale ne porte de trace de blessure ou d’ébréchure."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se han encontrado innumerables fósiles de este Pokémon y prácticamente ninguno presenta daños en la parte facial."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Many fossils of this Pokémon have been found, but almost none have shown signs of damage to the face."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"多くの 化石が みつかっているが 顔の 部分が 傷ついていたり 欠けているものは ほぼ ない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Grâce à sa tête très robuste, on suppose qu’il n’avait que très peu d’ennemis. Il vivait dans les forêts primaires, il y a fort longtemps."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Debido a la extraordinaria dureza de su rostro, se piensa que tenía pocos enemigos. Vivía en las junglas prehistóricas."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon lived in primeval jungles. Few enemies would have been willing to square off against its heavily armored face, so it’s thought."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"頑丈な 顔の おかげで 敵は 少なかったと 思われる。 太古の ジャングルに 棲んでいた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Cet herbivore, très calme de nature, utilisait la peau durcie de son museau pour déterrer des racines à grignoter."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un Pokémon herbívoro de carácter afable. Con su dura protección facial podía desenterrar las raíces de los árboles para comérselas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A mild-mannered, herbivorous Pokémon, it used its face to dig up tree roots to eat. The skin on its face was plenty tough."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"草食の おとなしい ポケモン。 丈夫な 顔の 皮膚で 地面を 掘り 木の根っこなども 食っていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"On retrouve des fossiles de Dinoclier dans les couches sédimentaires préhistoriques, mais seule sa tête a résisté à l’épreuve du temps."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Los fósiles que se han encontrado hasta ahora en estratos prehistóricos pertenecen solo a su cara."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Although its fossils can be found in layers of primeval rock, nothing but its face has ever been discovered."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"太古の 地層から 化石が 見つかるが 顔の 部分 以外が 発見 されたことは ない。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Much remains unknown about this Pokémon, as few have ever seen it. However, we know that it is calm and dislikes conflict, and it enjoys polishing its face against trees and rocks."}],"varieties":[{"id":410,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[24,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[8,"level-up",15],[9,"level-up",15],[10,"level-up",15],[11,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",15],[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[23,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[24,"level-up",47],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machin